<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIAN BOARD PRESIDENT'S XI V AUSTRALIA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIAN BOARD PRESIDENT'S XI V AUSTRALIA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>PATIALA, India 1996-10-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the opening</p>
<p>day of a three-day match between an Indian Board President's XI</p>
<p>and Australia on Saturday:</p>
<p>Australia first innings</p>
<p> M.Slater not out			52</p>
<p> M.Taylor c Karim b Ganesh	   20</p>
<p> R.Ponting not out		     45</p>
<p> Extras (b-1 lb-1 nb-3)		 5</p>
<p> Total (for one wicket)	     122</p>
<p>Fall of wicket: 1-37</p>
<p>To bat: M.Waugh, S.Waugh, M.Bevan, I.Healy, P.Reiffel, D.</p>
<p>Fleming, G.McGrath, P.McIntyre</p>
<p>Bowling (to date): Johnson 7-1-28-0, Ganesh 8-0-49-1 (nb3),</p>
<p>Kapoor 6-1-19-0, Hirwani 7-3-18-0, Joshi 2-0-6-0</p>
<p>Indian Board President's XI: Sanjay Manjrekar (captain),</p>
<p>Vikram Rathore, V.V.S. Laxman, Vinod Kambli, Pankaj Dharmani,</p>
<p>Saba Karim, Sunil Joshi, Aashish Kapoor, David Johnson, D.</p>
<p>Ganesh, Narendra Hirwani.</p>
